# TRIP_ACCESS_CODE and TRIP_GUEST_CODE are gone. They were shared codes that
# reached every trip in the database, which no per-trip membership can
# constrain — a code is a right, not a person. Everyone signs in with an
# account now (below), and friends are invited to a trip as viewers, with
# per-member control over whether they see the stays, the flight and the
# documents. Delete both from any deployment that still sets them.

# Data backend: "memory" (placeholder data, no infra needed) | "supabase" (Phase 8)
DATA_BACKEND=memory

# --- Supabase backend (set DATA_BACKEND=supabase) ---
# SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_...   # the "secret" API key (Settings → API); server-only, bypasses RLS, never shipped to the browser
# (legacy projects: SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY with the service_role JWT also works)

# --- Account sign-in via Supabase Auth (Google OAuth, email + password, magic-link) ---
# Required: with these unset there is no way into the app at all.
# Registration is open: anyone can create an account, and sees nothing until
# they create a trip or are invited to one. There is no allow-list — the old
# TRIP_OWNER_EMAILS var was replaced by the trip_members table and is ignored.
#
# Google sign-in needs the provider enabled in the Supabase dashboard
# (Authentication → Providers → Google) with the OAuth client's redirect set to
# https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback. Nothing is needed here:
# the browser talks to Supabase directly and the API only ever verifies the
# resulting JWT. With the provider off, the button is simply disabled.
#
# Needed regardless of DATA_BACKEND — Supabase Auth is a property of the
# Supabase project, not of which datastore is selected. SUPABASE_URL (above)
# is reused; the publishable key is safe to also expose to the frontend as
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY (see src/lib/supabaseClient.ts).
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...

# --- PostHog product analytics (browser) ---
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_your_public_project_token
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com
